OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over garage and
OL,4,Awarehouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FKurram Shahzad, 37, who lives in the
OL,7,FBelle Vale area of Liverpool and is
OL,8,Foriginally from Pakistan, has been
OL,9,Fcharged with arson with recklessness as
OL,10,Fto whether life was endangered,
OL,11,FMerseyside Police said.
